 621:../src/FreeRTOS/event_groups.c ****                     /* Store the actual event flag value in the task's event list
 622:../src/FreeRTOS/event_groups.c ****                      * item before removing the task from the event list.  The
 623:../src/FreeRTOS/event_groups.c ****                      * eventUNBLOCKED_DUE_TO_BIT_SET bit is set so the task knows
 624:../src/FreeRTOS/event_groups.c ****                      * that is was unblocked due to its required bits matching, rather
